# Quantaureum Docker build context exclusions
# Mirrors .gitignore policy: only source enters the image. Sensitive /
# operational / runtime data must NEVER be baked into a docker context.
# 2026-09-08: the unfiltered context was 13.3 GB (.local-only alone = 12 GB).

# Secrets & ops quarantine — ABSOLUTE
.local-only/
**/.local-only/
.githooks/
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
keys/
testnet/keys/
devnet-work/
.devnet-work/
.devnet-work
**/dev_accounts.json
**/dev_accounts*.json
validators/**/wallet.json
.env
.env.*
*.local

# VCS / AI tooling
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.golangci.yml
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.agents/
.cursor/
AGENTS.md

# Build artifacts & runtime data
build/
data/
data*/
logs/
*.log
*.db
*.lock
certs/
coverage*
*.out
*.test

# Docs & non-runtime files (small but irrelevant to the image)
docs/
wiki/
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
SECURITY.md
LICENSE
README*.md
*.md
!cmd/**/*.md

# Test heavy dirs (not needed in runtime image build)
tests/
.qrcode/
scripts/
Makefile
